    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8ee6018264f31eb1fa1038b0af3beffc.poster.avif?t=1746974772\" width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8ee6018264f31eb1fa1038b0af3beffc.webm?t=1746974772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8ee6018264f31eb1fa1038b0af3beffc.mp4?t=1746974772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note!!! This game requires a front facing camera to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cLips Breaker\u201d is the industry's first Arkanoid game that incorporates facial control technology. It revolutionarily uses the shape of the player's mouth as the instant form of the little ball baffle. In this game, you need to flexibly swing your lips in front of the camera to control the baffle to bounce the little ball, accurately smash the bricks to win. This is not only a challenge to reaction speed and facial expression movements, but also an unprecedented fun experience.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 8 chapters, 9 levels each, for a total of 72 well-designed levels, each with a unique brick layout and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/b2ab282f0fae3cea1b0a03d5aaf01e2e.avif?t=1746974772\" data-has-big width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 unique props, covering a variety of special effects such as buffs and debuffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 special bricks, diverse in type, with different attributes and effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 mechanism designs, flexibly controlled by facial expressions, highly interactive and fun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 creatures (including boss battles), either cute or dangerous, providing a diverse combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/47592df089df46bf6bc1a76031e4c6be.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/1296f040785dfc22c48f508746a55664.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/936d74d9a748182080076fae898cb51f.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8a296d185f89efd25cca3891d1521539.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Unique face-controlled gameplay\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The novel face-controlled gameplay provides excellent live broadcast effects. It can also relax the body and mind by freeing up the hands and exercising the facial muscles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Sophisticated control experience\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real-time shape of the mouth can be used as a baffle to precisely control the bounce of the ball, testing the player's reaction speed and operating skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Rich game content and systems\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to exciting levels, it also offers a thrilling prize machine, an exhaustive illustration book and a colorful skin system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Level editor and creative workshop\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely use your creativity to design levels and share them in the creative workshop to interact with other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Global leaderboard\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your ranking by challenging the fastest clearance time record and compete with players from all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a fun and challenging Arkanoid experience. Whether you are a big fan of Arkanoid games, a game lover who wants to try a new way of playing, or a live streaming expert, you can find your own fun and sense of achievement in this game.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8ee6018264f31eb1fa1038b0af3beffc.poster.avif?t=1746974772\" width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8ee6018264f31eb1fa1038b0af3beffc.webm?t=1746974772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8ee6018264f31eb1fa1038b0af3beffc.mp4?t=1746974772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note!!! This game requires a front facing camera to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cLips Breaker\u201d is the industry's first Arkanoid game that incorporates facial control technology. It revolutionarily uses the shape of the player's mouth as the instant form of the little ball baffle. In this game, you need to flexibly swing your lips in front of the camera to control the baffle to bounce the little ball, accurately smash the bricks to win. This is not only a challenge to reaction speed and facial expression movements, but also an unprecedented fun experience.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 8 chapters, 9 levels each, for a total of 72 well-designed levels, each with a unique brick layout and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/b2ab282f0fae3cea1b0a03d5aaf01e2e.avif?t=1746974772\" data-has-big width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 unique props, covering a variety of special effects such as buffs and debuffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 special bricks, diverse in type, with different attributes and effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 mechanism designs, flexibly controlled by facial expressions, highly interactive and fun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 creatures (including boss battles), either cute or dangerous, providing a diverse combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/47592df089df46bf6bc1a76031e4c6be.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/1296f040785dfc22c48f508746a55664.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/936d74d9a748182080076fae898cb51f.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126660/extras/8a296d185f89efd25cca3891d1521539.avif?t=1746974772\" width=80 height=80 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Unique face-controlled gameplay\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The novel face-controlled gameplay provides excellent live broadcast effects. It can also relax the body and mind by freeing up the hands and exercising the facial muscles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Sophisticated control experience\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real-time shape of the mouth can be used as a baffle to precisely control the bounce of the ball, testing the player's reaction speed and operating skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Rich game content and systems\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to exciting levels, it also offers a thrilling prize machine, an exhaustive illustration book and a colorful skin system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Level editor and creative workshop\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely use your creativity to design levels and share them in the creative workshop to interact with other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726Global leaderboard\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your ranking by challenging the fastest clearance time record and compete with players from all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a fun and challenging Arkanoid experience. Whether you are a big fan of Arkanoid games, a game lover who wants to try a new way of playing, or a live streaming expert, you can find your own fun and sense of achievement in this game.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cLips Breaker\u201d is the world's first Arkanoid game to incorporate facial control technology. You can swing your lips to manipulate the baffle to bounce the ball and break the bricks to win the game. The novel gameplay and well-designed levels will bring you an unprecedented Arkanoid experience.",
